il from within  princess zelda which could then lead to  the mouse returning to ganondorf's  corpse for an epic final battle with  ganondorf link and zelda yes bandit  indeed it could as cool as that sounds  it still leaves so many questions  lingering like how exactly does this  murals prophecy tie into zelda's  apparent relationship with the goddess  hylia also how do we even know that that  is the goddess hylia and what's with the  symbolism behind the hand cupping and  oroboros dragons for all of those  questions be sure to head on over to  celtic's video that's live right now  over on his channel where we crack down  and cover exactly that and a huge thanks  to the man himself for helping out with  this theory thanks for having me for a  closer look at why we think this figure  could be the goddess hylia jump over to  my channel thank you all so much for  watching and if you feel the will of  highly eliting you please consider  leaving a like on this video to get it  spread around on youtube a little bit  more and subscribe if you haven't  already for many more videos to come  huge thanks as always to my bandit crew  who make my day every day and to those  who have been supporting me via my brand  new kovi page seriously you guys mean  the world to me follow me on my socials  and that's about all i've got in this  one this is bandit looking forward to  seeing you next time and signing out  peace  [Music]  you

